子盾，少曆顯位。永嘉中，為徐州刺史，委任長史司馬奧。奧勸盾刑殺立威，大發良人為兵，有不奉法者罪便至死。在任三年，百姓嗟怨。東海王越，盾妹夫也。越既薨，騎督滿衡便引所發良人東還。尋而劉元海遣將王桑、趙固向彭城，前鋒數騎至下邳，文武不堪苛政，悉皆散走，盾、奧奔淮陰，妻子為賊人所得。奧又誘盾降趙固。固妻盾女，有寵，盾向女涕泣，固遂殺之。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0000"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"長兄","source_clause_binding":{"kind":"biography_family_clause","rule":"ranked_older_brothers","roles":{"head":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0000","first":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0003","second":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0007"},"clause_start":0,"clause_end":9,"paragraph_sha256":"8f2f5b84d2a58e9b2a2f4bab0e8538b1eb37c85e790c1f57bfacc84a904be772","revision_id":2506399},"relative_birth_order":{"older_person_id":"2vl_svq_ynl","younger_person_id":"530_f9d_4bd","operator":"lt","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null,"scope":"siblings"}},"interpretation_note":"只記完整原文所述及限定的上下文指涉；不由婚配、排行或宗祧承繼推未載生母、父系世距或法律收養。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-jin035-pei-li-kang","subject_person_id":"2vl_svq_ynl","predicate":"brother","object_person_id":"y8f_xr3_osd","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peikai-ws2506399","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016","quote":"楷長兄黎，次兄康，並知名。康子盾，少曆顯位。永嘉中，為徐州刺史，委任長史司馬奧。奧勸盾刑殺立威，大發良人為兵，有不奉法者罪便至死。在任三年，百姓嗟怨。東海王越，盾妹夫也。越既薨，騎督滿衡便引所發良人東還。尋而劉元海遣將王桑、趙固向彭城，前鋒數騎至下邳，文武不堪苛政，悉皆散走，盾、奧奔淮陰，妻子為賊人所得。奧又誘盾降趙固。固妻盾女，有寵，盾向女涕泣，固遂殺之。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0007"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"長兄黎，次兄康","source_clause_binding":{"kind":"biography_family_clause","rule":"ranked_older_brothers","roles":{"head":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0000","first":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0003","second":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0007"},"clause_start":0,"clause_e